Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:11.12,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Hey... Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:11.86,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:14.57,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Do you think... maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:16.37,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:20.00,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I b-baked the cookies this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:22.46,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I don't know if you'll like them, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:32.16,main,fudo,0,0,0,,They're shockingly delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:33.67,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:35.91,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:46.36,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:47.21,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:50.49,main,fudo,0,0,0,,On a day with the perfect date weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.49,0:00:53.02,main,fudo,0,0,0,,eating sweet things made by \Nthe person I love the most...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:56.04,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:58.50,main,fudo,0,0,0,,I'm the luckiest man in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:01.96,main,desumi,0,0,0,,You just love to exaggerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.65,0:01:56.73,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Ah, Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.73,0:01:58.35,main,desumi,0,0,0,,You are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.85,0:02:00.72,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I could look at you for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:03.64,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:06.30,main,desumi,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't stare!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:08.10,main,desumi,0,0,0,,You're not even blinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:10.62,main,desumi,0,0,0,,But don't get the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:13.77,main,desumi,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:18.11,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I'm just not... used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:19.59,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Oh so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:19.99,sign_3317_26_The_cuteness,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(87,198)}Oh so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.73,0:02:21.77,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.39,0:02:24.70,main,fudo,0,0,0,,I have a serious favor to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:25.77,main,desumi,0,0,0,,A favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.31,0:02:33.45,main,fudo,0,0,0,,According to the specialist \Ntexts I consulted on the topic,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.99,0:02:36.51,main,fudo,0,0,0,,couples are supposed to hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:39.26,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Do you think {\i1}we{\i0} could try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:42.97,main,desumi,0,0,0,,H-Hold hands? Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.41,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:00.20,main,desumi,0,0,0,,It's just too soon for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.15,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:02.39,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I said I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:03.12,main,fudo,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:05.06,main,desumi,0,0,0,,T-Think about it, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:08.35,main,desumi,0,0,0,,This is only our third-ever date!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:09.54,main,desumi,0,0,0,,It's premature!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.13,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Statistics suggest that hand-holding tends \Nto happen on the second or third date!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:15.29,main,desumi,0,0,0,,The average couple is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:46.45,main,blue,0,0,0,,You okay up here, Red?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.21,sign_5517_46_Allow_me_to_expl,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(375,200)\blur4}Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.21,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.21,0:03:56.96,sign_5568_47_Freezing_Sentai_,sign,0,0,0,,Freezing Sentai {\c&H6567E2&}Gelato {\c&HF3E57B&}5
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:56.96,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,Freezing Sentai Gelato \N5's leader, Red Gelato,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:58.96,sign_5682_51_Aikawa,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(105,180)\fad(318,1)}Aikawa
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:58.96,sign_5682_51_Aikawa,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,175)\fad(318,1)}Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:58.96,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,a.k.a. Fudo Aikawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:04.84,sign_5730_53_Secret_Society_G,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(485,25)\blur4}Secret Society Gekko
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:03.07,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,and leader of combatants \Nfor Secret Society Gekko,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:07.43,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,the Reaper Princess, a.k.a. Desumi Magahara...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:06.85,sign_5871_55_Missing,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Desumi Magahara
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.43,0:04:11.23,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,have climbed the insurmountable wall \Nthat stands between their organizations
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:14.16,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,to engage in a taboo relationship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:52.66,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(318,55)\fscx95\fad(920,1)}Episode 1    {\fscx100\fsp3}I Love You!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:50.16,italics,blue,0,0,0,,What an intense battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:52.66,italics,blue,0,0,0,,I don't think there's \Nanything I can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:54.57,main,blue,0,0,0,,I'm leaving this to you, Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:00.33,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:04.98,main,fudo,0,0,0,,We're holding hands right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:10.78,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Y-You mean... we did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:11.18,main,fudo,0,0,0,,We did!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:13.80,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Isn't it wonderful, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:21.62,main,desumi,0,0,0,,And doing it with interlocked \Nfingers like we did
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:23.23,main,desumi,0,0,0,,is apparently a very advanced act!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.18,0:06:27.87,main,desumi,0,0,0,,It's a day worth remembering—\Nthe first time we held hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:30.51,italics,fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:33.90,italics,fudo,0,0,0,,My first-ever girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:38.75,sign_9447_74_1_Week_Earlier,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(545,160)}1 Week\N Earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:37.71,italicstop,fudo,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I worked up my courage that day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:38.75,sign_3317_26_The_cuteness,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(245,280)\fs16\fad(260,1)}Hero Sentai\NGelato 5 Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:48.47,sign_9720_77_Red_Gelato_Fudo_,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(520,90)\fs15\fsp4}Red Gelato\N{\fs20\fsp0}Fudo Aikawa
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:54.30,flashback,haru,0,0,0,,Good morning, Fudo-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:56.63,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Hey. Morning, Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:58.43,sign_9720_77_Red_Gelato_Fudo_,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(120,265)\c&HFF5FFC&\fs15\fsp4}Pink Gelato\N{\fs20\fsp0}Haru Arisugawa
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:06:58.43,flashback,haru,0,0,0,,You can use this, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:07:00.47,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Thanks, I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.47,0:07:01.74,flashback,haru,0,0,0,,It's nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:03.69,flashback,haru,0,0,0,,But I guess it's almost time \Nfor the meeting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:05.29,flashback,haru,0,0,0,,Want to walk there together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:06.86,sign_10159_85_Refreshing__Goes,sign,0,0,0,,Refreshing!\NGoes down easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:06.86,sign_10159_86_For_building_ide,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\pos(30,295)}For building ideal muscles\N\N{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB31314&\shad0\bord4\fs13}Protein 98.5%
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:06.86,sign_10159_88_Delicious_Milk,sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HEDF5F2&\3c&H63C51F&\bord4\fs18}The Rich Flavor\N\N{\c&H5D38B2&\3c&HF3F7EC&\bord4}100% Real Milk
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:06.86,sign_10159_88_Delicious_Milk,sign,0,0,0,,{\fax0.36\pos(450,135)\frz333.8}Delicious Milk
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:05.97,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:09.12,flashback,hayato,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:12.87,flashback,hayato,0,0,0,,A date with me is all \Nthe excitement you need!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:15.87,flashbacktop,female staffer,0,0,0,,Actually... I'm rather busy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:15.87,flashback,haru,0,0,0,,Hayato-san's at it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:19.45,sign_9720_77_Red_Gelato_Fudo_,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(520,275)\c&HE50008&\fs15\fsp4\fad(1,262)}Blue Gelato\N{\fs20\fsp0}Hayato Ojino
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:17.46,flashback,hayato,0,0,0,,Where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:19.45,flashback,hayato,0,0,0,,Karaoke? A club?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:22.50,flashbacktop,female staffer,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:22.95,flashback,hayato,0,0,0,,Just don't fall in love too fast \Nwhen you see me on the dance floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:24.25,flashback,hayato,0,0,0,,Just leave it all to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:24.25,flashbacktop,female staffer,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.62,0:07:27.25,flashback,hayato,0,0,0,,Providing a cool escort for \Nan adorable little kitten
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:28.67,flashback,hayato,0,0,0,,is my form of justi—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:35.01,flashback,hayato,0,0,0,,She knows she wants me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:40.08,flashbacktop,misaki,0,0,0,,Look at you, right on time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:40.73,sign_9720_77_Red_Gelato_Fudo_,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(115,275)\c&H13B7E8&\fs15\fsp4}Yellow Gelato\N{\fs20\fsp0}Misaki Jinguji
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:43.48,sign_9720_77_Red_Gelato_Fudo_,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(508,95)\fs15\fsp4\c&H03B309&\bord3}Green Gelato\N{\fs20\fsp0}Daigo Todoroki
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:42.43,flashback,daigo,0,0,0,,It seems we're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:44.50,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:55.19,flashbacktop,professor,0,0,0,,Good morning, Gelato 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:55.82,sign_9720_77_Red_Gelato_Fudo_,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(485,275)\c&H000000&\fs15\fsp4\fad(260,1)}Gelato 5 Commander\N{\fs20\fsp0}Professor Big Gelato
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:07:57.22,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:07:58.31,flashback,misaki,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.31,0:07:59.56,flashback,hayato,0,0,0,,Mornin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:00.99,flashback,haru,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.55,0:08:03.52,flashback,daigo,0,0,0,,Professor, the package you requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.52,0:08:06.33,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,It's appreciated as always, Daigo-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.93,0:08:10.13,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,What a fine smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:11.77,flashback,misaki,0,0,0,,Croissants!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:13.97,flashback,misaki,0,0,0,,Hey, can I have some too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:15.95,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,Of course you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:19.14,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,Feel free to help yourselves while I talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:24.23,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:31.00,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,A powerful Gekko combatant who began \Nappearing roughly six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:36.62,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,As you all know, Gekko is a secret \Nsociety plotting world domination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:41.25,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,But the appearance of the Reaper Princess has \Nmade them more formidable than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:43.76,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,I want you all to engage her with caution!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:50.30,flashback italics,base announcer,0,0,0,,Secret Society Gekko appearance detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:53.26,flashback italics,base announcer,0,0,0,,Gelato 5, move out at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.74,0:08:57.80,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,Gelato 5, move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.26,0:09:01.93,flashback,man,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:13.19,sign_13157_132_Princess_Series_,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(183,290)}Princess Series\NReaper Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:13.19,sign_13157_132_Princess_Series_,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(329,290)\fs9}Gekko Monster\N{\fs15}Culverin Bear
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:13.19,sign_13157_132_Princess_Series_,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(465,290)}Moonlight\N Soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:12.53,flashbacktop,culverin,0,0,0,,Cower in fear, pathetic humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:14.61,flashback,boy A,0,0,0,,It's Gekko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:16.82,flashback,boy B,0,0,0,,Man, Culverin Bear is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:18.81,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,That's enough of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:21.35,flashback,culverin,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:22.83,flashback,boys,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.95,0:09:31.25,flashback,gelato 5,0,0,0,,Freezing Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:33.01,flashback italics,changer,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:34.46,flashback italics,changer,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:35.92,flashback italics,changer,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:37.38,flashback italics,changer,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.01,flashback italics,changer,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:43.05,flashback italics,changer,0,0,0,,Change Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:59.28,flashback,red,0,0,0,,The aroma of strawberry, \Nthe flavor of justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:01.44,flashback,red,0,0,0,,Red Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:05.54,flashback,blue,0,0,0,,The aroma of soda, the flavor of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.07,0:10:07.60,flashback,blue,0,0,0,,Blue Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:11.81,flashback,yellow,0,0,0,,The aroma of lemon, the flavor of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:13.78,flashback,yellow,0,0,0,,Yellow Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:18.05,flashback,pink,0,0,0,,The aroma of peach, the flavor of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:20.16,flashback,pink,0,0,0,,Pink Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:24.68,flashback,green,0,0,0,,The aroma of pistachio, the flavor of peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:26.67,flashback,green,0,0,0,,Green Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:29.56,flashback,gelato 5,0,0,0,,Together, we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:33.07,flashback,gelato 5,0,0,0,,Freezing Sentai Gelato 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:37.20,flashback,red,0,0,0,,Underestimate us on pain of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:40.20,flashback,culverin,0,0,0,,We'll have our revenge at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:42.10,flashback,culverin,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:49.36,flashback,red,0,0,0,,Sweet Berry Impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.95,0:10:57.13,flashback,yellow,0,0,0,,Megaton Lemon Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:04.27,flashback,pink,0,0,0,,Sky Peach Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:13.06,flashback,green,0,0,0,,Vacuum Pistachio Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:21.32,flashback,blue,0,0,0,,Twin Soda Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:24.24,flashback,boys,0,0,0,,Heroes rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:29.34,flashback,culverin,0,0,0,,Impressive as ever, Gelato 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:33.54,flashback,culverin,0,0,0,,But the rest won't be so easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:57.77,flashback,red,0,0,0,,The rest of you, handle Culverin Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:11:59.90,flashback,red,0,0,0,,I'll take the Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:01.28,flashback,red,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:02.28,flashback,others,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:40.46,flashback,culverin,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:43.40,flashback,culverin,0,0,0,,Let's call it off for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:45.88,flashback,culverin,0,0,0,,B-But I'll get you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:52.18,flashback,reaper,0,0,0,,I've never met someone who \Ncould keep up with me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:58.54,flashback,reaper,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is what they call destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:02.36,flashback,reaper,0,0,0,,We'll meet again... Red Gelato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.39,0:13:15.41,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,Lick, lick...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:19.40,flashback italics,professor,0,0,0,,Fighting in the morning, \Ntraining in the afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:23.98,flashback italics,professor,0,0,0,,He's a role model for all heroes \Nwith a work ethic like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.93,0:13:55.43,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,What's going on in your life, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.43,0:13:58.94,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,Don't you do anything but bodybuilding?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:03.15,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,There's something on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:03.94,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:06.02,flashback italics,professor,0,0,0,,Knowing Fudo-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.02,0:14:10.24,flashback italics,professor,0,0,0,,he's probably mulling over issues of world \Npeace, or perhaps the nature of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.88,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I was thinking about the woman I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:15.62,flashback italics,professor,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:17.46,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,F-Fudo-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:19.88,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,Y-You've developed a crush?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:21.70,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,It was love at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:24.90,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I've never been in love before now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.90,0:14:27.58,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,H-Have you told her how you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:28.34,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.91,0:14:30.52,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I'm a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.96,0:14:33.10,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,She and I live in two different wo—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:35.10,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:36.51,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,P-Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.51,0:14:39.12,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,What's there to say a \Nhero can't fall in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:40.77,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,You're as human as the rest of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:43.65,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,You must tell her how you feel at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.87,0:14:44.65,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.15,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:47.49,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Are you sure, Professor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.23,0:14:52.88,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,Love will bring you to the \Nnext stage of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:54.91,flashback,professor,0,0,0,,I'll take responsibility \Nfor whatever happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:14:57.91,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Very well, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:14:59.26,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:05.36,flashback italics,professor,0,0,0,,I always thought his single-minded \Nfocus on bodybuilding was sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:08.17,flashback italics,professor,0,0,0,,but it's good to see he's \Na red-blooded young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:14.07,flashback italics,professor,0,0,0,,But what kind of woman could it \Nbe, who's stolen Fudo-kun's heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:16.92,flashback italics,professor,0,0,0,,Could it be a nurse, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:18.64,flashback italics,professor,0,0,0,,I've a fondness for nurses myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:34.64,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,I was surprised by your invitation \Nto this little tête-à-tête, Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:38.16,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,But you don't have to explain...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:41.41,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,You want to pick up where we left off, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:44.95,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,I was hoping to settle things myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:55.05,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:04.81,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.81,0:16:05.90,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:07.94,sign_23143_224_Clink___,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(525,150,525,128,1,715)\frz335.5\fad(40,1)}Clink...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:10.92,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Love After World Domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.27,0:16:14.37,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:15.22,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,{\fs22}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:16.49,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,{\fs20}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:18.03,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,{\fs18}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:21.66,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,From the moment we first met...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:24.03,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I've loved you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:27.88,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I just wanted to tell you—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.00,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,Now hang on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:29.85,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.49,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,We're mortal enemies, remember?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.49,0:16:32.47,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly sane!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:33.82,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,Did you hit your head somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:34.53,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:36.64,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I got Professor Big Gelato's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:39.13,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,Exactly, there's no way he'd permit—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:40.07,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:44.71,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,Of course... I see your game now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.01,0:16:51.37,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,You know I've had no experience with such \Nthings... and you're teasing me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.36,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,How humiliating!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:54.40,flashback italics,fudo,0,0,0,,Squee...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:55.74,sign_24298_247_squee,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(150,45,145,25,1,821)\fad(40,1)}squee
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:58.01,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,Using that as a pretext \Nto throw me off my game...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:01.45,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed in you, Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:02.79,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,No, I swear—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:06.54,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this, fiend!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:08.42,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,It's not like that, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:10.66,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,I haven't given you \Npermission to use my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:14.51,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,No man could possibly ever love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:19.05,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,I'm the kind of woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:23.45,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,whose comrades spread rumors that \Nmy favorite food is raw bear meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:27.98,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,It's not! Your favorite foods \Nare pancakes and pasta!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:30.43,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,How would you know that, creep?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:34.94,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,They also say that I drink \Nthe blood of wild boars!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:37.99,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,No! You mainly drink green smoothies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:41.03,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,They say I wander the streets at \Nnight seeking strong men to beat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.03,0:17:42.58,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,At night, you do Pilates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:45.71,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,That I'm an alien killing machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:55.73,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,You were born...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.72,0:17:58.38,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,in Hakata!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:00.89,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,How did you know all that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:09.02,sign_25916_268_Desumi_Magahara,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(409,25)}Desumi Magahara
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:09.02,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HF8FCF7&\bord0\shad0}m 355 179 l 357 234 460 233 469 202 458 182
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:09.02,sign_25916_268_Desumi_Magahara,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,185)}1 like \NI made mentaiko pasta\N#homecooking\N#wishIwasbetteratit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:09.02,sign_25916_268_Desumi_Magahara,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(361,238)}\NComments
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:04.34,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I looked through all your \Nsocial media accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:08.75,sign_25916_268_Desumi_Magahara,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(365,284)\frz0.5756}H{\alphaFF\t(366,367,\alpha00)}ell{\alphaFF\t(1033,1034,\alpha00)}o t{\alphaFF\t(1283,1284,\alpha00)}he{\alphaFF\t(2326,2327,\alpha00)}re{\alphaFF\t(2826,2827,\alpha00)}, i{\alphaFF\t(3118,3119,\alpha00)}t {\alphaFF\t(3702,3703,\alpha00)}lo{\alphaFF\t(4370,4371,\alpha00)}ok{\alphaFF\t(4828,4829,\alpha00)}s {\alphaFF\t(5037,5038,\alpha00)}d{\alphaFF\t(5707,5708,\alpha00)}el{\alphaFF\t(6121,6122,\alpha00)}ic{\alphaFF\t(6246,6247,\alpha00)}io{\alphaFF\t(6997,6998,\alpha00)}us
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:09.02,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,And those replies from "Proteinman"... \NThey're from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:09.02,sign_25916_268_Desumi_Magahara,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\frz0.5756\pos(381,288)}Hello there, it looks delicious
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:13.02,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,You're no killing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:15.28,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,You always do your nails up in a cute way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.67,0:18:17.40,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,you love your fancy accessories,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:20.31,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,and you change up your perfume \Nbased on how you feel that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:23.14,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,You're as real as a girl can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:26.67,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,Real girls don't wield flails.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:28.99,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.99,0:18:31.62,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,B-But we're enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.62,0:18:33.17,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,I think we can work it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.55,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:39.54,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Would you please be my girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:41.51,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,I-It's not possible—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:44.11,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san, I mean this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.94,0:19:00.45,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:09.33,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,I... I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:16.20,flashback,desumi,0,0,0,,B-But just so you know, I don't know \Nanything about the mechanics of dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:18.45,flashback,fudo,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I don't know, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:26.70,sign_3317_26_The_cuteness,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(502,1)\pos(545,180)}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:25.14,main,desumi,0,0,0,,By the way, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:27.74,main,desumi,0,0,0,,When I headed out this morning, \Nmy cat did the funniest—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.74,0:19:29.41,main,fudo,0,0,0,,H-Hang on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:31.81,main,fudo,0,0,0,,You have a cat, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.81,0:19:34.07,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Oh? You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:37.65,main,desumi,0,0,0,,The great Fudo didn't even know I have a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.31,0:19:40.80,main,fudo,0,0,0,,There's still so much I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.63,0:19:42.92,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I'll take pity on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:45.20,main,desumi,0,0,0,,and give you a special little peek!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:47.95,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Her name's Hellko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:49.70,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Well? Isn't she a sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.19,0:19:53.36,italics,fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san caught herself in the shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:56.84,italics,fudo,0,0,0,,And it looks like she \Njust got out of the bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:20:00.18,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Can a man truly feel this much happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:03.07,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Well, I know Hellko's pretty cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.07,0:20:05.38,main,desumi,0,0,0,,but you really do love to exaggerate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:06.85,main,fudo,0,0,0,,It's hardly an exaggeration.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.13,0:20:10.63,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Just being with you really \Nmakes me that happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:14.10,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:17.61,main,desumi,0,0,0,,But don't forget, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:22.49,main,desumi,0,0,0,,We can't let anybody know about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:30.33,sign_29315_315_Failure_of_Justi,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,1)}Failure of Justice\N{\fs30\c&HED8443&\3c&HFFFFFF&} Daily Hero {\c&HF5EBF0&\3c&HDB5929&}(Extra)\N{\fs20\c&HE07231&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2}Reaper Princess {\c&H3EC9C9&\3c&H191EBD&}Steamy Love {\c&H381BD5&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Red\N{\c&H2DBEBA&\3c&H2E2FC2&\fs15}Photos of their tryst in the middle of work!\N{\c&H434443&\3c&HF7F3F2&}No denial of the reports of their affair
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:30.33,sign_29315_315_Failure_of_Justi,sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs25\c&HECF2E9&\3c&HAD2022&\fad(80,1)}It's true!\N{\c&H2D2E29&\3c&H5858D6&}A Hero Dethroned!\N{\c&H35C4B4&\3c&H381EC3&}An unprecedented scandal\N{\c&H351BC3&\3c&HE0DED3&}Hero\N{\c&HD4572D&}Secret Society
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.36,0:20:26.10,main,desumi,0,0,0,,If this comes out, we won't \Nbe able to stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:30.33,main,desumi,0,0,0,,It might even become national news!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:32.38,main,fudo,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:34.56,main,fudo,0,0,0,,I'm not much of a secretive person,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.54,main,fudo,0,0,0,,but I will keep this secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:37.59,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:39.66,main,desumi,0,0,0,,But some day...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.95,0:20:44.02,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I hope the world becomes a place where \Nwe can see each other, heads held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:46.34,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Right, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.87,0:20:49.81,italics,fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.85,0:20:51.97,italics,fudo,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:54.48,main,yellow,0,0,0,,Red, we're done—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:55.44,sign_30078_329_snap,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(170,115,160,105)}snap
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.73,sign_5871_55_Missing,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Rum{\alphaFF\t(630,882,\alpha00)}ba of the {\alphaFF\t(1006,1215,\alpha00)}Rea{\alphaFF\t(1257,1507,\alpha00)}per
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.73,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Rumba of the Reaper!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:05.82,main,yellow,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:07.49,main,yellow,0,0,0,,R-Red, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.29,0:21:11.72,main,fudo,0,0,0,,I-Impressive indeed, Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:16.01,main,fudo,0,0,0,,I'll see that you pay for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.01,0:21:17.67,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Let us meet again... soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.89,0:21:21.56,main,desumi,0,0,0,,V-Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:22.92,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I'll be ready and waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:25.43,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Farewell, Fudo... Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:27.84,main,desumi,0,0,0,,I'll meet you, whenever you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.36,0:21:30.81,main,desumi,0,0,0,,Perhaps the day after tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:34.02,main,yellow,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:36.05,main,fudo,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.56,0:21:38.31,sign_5517_46_Allow_me_to_expl,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur4\an8}Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:38.31,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.99,0:21:42.37,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,This is the story of a hero of justice
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.37,0:21:44.20,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,and a secret society's combatant
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:48.32,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,beginning their journey down \Nthe road of forbidden love!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:40.25,sign_33566_350_Preview,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(380,110)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:23.30,main,professor,0,0,0,,Training again? A true inspiration!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.30,0:23:24.64,main,professor,0,0,0,,By the way, Fudo-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.64,0:23:27.08,main,professor,0,0,0,,Speaking as the one who \Npushed you to go for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.08,0:23:30.28,main,professor,0,0,0,,I was wondering... How'd the confession go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:32.29,main,professor,0,0,0,,Oh? Maybe he's not listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.29,0:23:34.29,main,professor,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.29,0:23:37.15,top,fudo,0,0,0,,Next time on {\i1}Love After World Domination{\i0}:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.41,0:23:40.25,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(40,300)\fad(503,1)}Episode 2     {\fscx90}The Truth About Dating
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.15,0:23:39.45,top,fudo,0,0,0,,Episode 2: "The Truth About Dating"!
